Subject: plug-in: the switches also from /var/tmp/metal.args (optional, for this port's measurements)

Every metal_* switch is read from kern.bootargs, which on this phone means building and flashing a boot image for
each one tried. hm_bootargs() appends the words of /var/tmp/metal.args to the kernel's. No kernel needs it.

---
diff --git a/userland/src/HakiosMetalCA.m b/userland/src/HakiosMetalCA.m
